---Set or rotate a repository secret
---
---Stores a repository secret (a customer-supplied model provider API key) encrypted at rest. Write-only: no endpoint ever returns the stored value — it can only be rotated (by setting it again) or deleted. The runner reads it in the repository's own cell, never over the API. Setting an existing key rotates it. Requires repo-admin (manage_settings): the stored key decides which account pays for the repository's model calls.
---
---`PUT /api/v1/repos/{repo_id}/secrets/{secretKey}`
---Errors: RepoNotInRegion.
---@param input entire.repo_settings.SetRepoSecretRequest
---@return entire.repo_settings.SetRepoSecretResponse? value
